{% extends "builder_base.html.j2" %}

{% block title %}Trailstory · Writing your memory…{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section
  class="bp-hero"
  x-data="{
    phase: 'writing',
    chunks: '',
    error: '',
    redirect: '',
    init() {
      const es = new EventSource('/generate/{{ slug }}/stream');
      es.addEventListener('chunk', (e) => {
        try { this.chunks += JSON.parse(e.data).text || ''; } catch (_) {}
      });
      es.addEventListener('status', (e) => {
        try { this.phase = JSON.parse(e.data).phase || this.phase; } catch (_) {}
      });
      es.addEventListener('done', (e) => {
        try { this.redirect = JSON.parse(e.data).redirect || ''; } catch (_) {}
        es.close();
        if (this.redirect) window.location = this.redirect;
      });
      es.addEventListener('error', (e) => {
        try {
          const detail = e.data ? JSON.parse(e.data) : null;
          this.error = (detail && detail.error) || 'connection lost';
        } catch (_) {
          this.error = 'connection lost';
        }
        es.close();
      });
    },
  }"
  data-slug="{{ slug }}"
  data-style="{{ style }}"
>
  <div class="bp-eyebrow">
    <span class="lang-en">STEP 3 / 3 · GENERATING</span>
    <span class="lang-ru">ШАГ 3 / 3 · ГЕНЕРАЦИЯ</span>
    <span class="lang-de">SCHRITT 3 / 3 · WIR SCHREIBEN</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="bp-h1">
    <span x-show="phase === 'writing'">
      <span class="lang-en"><span class="bp-h1-em">Writing</span><br>your memory…</span>
      <span class="lang-ru"><span class="bp-h1-em">Пишем</span><br>ваше воспоминание…</span>
      <span class="lang-de"><span class="bp-h1-em">Wir schreiben</span><br>deine Erinnerung…</span>
    </span>
    <span x-show="phase === 'regenerating'" x-cloak>
      <span class="lang-en"><span class="bp-h1-em">One more pass</span><br>tidier draft…</span>
      <span class="lang-ru"><span class="bp-h1-em">Ещё один проход</span><br>чтобы стало чище…</span>
      <span class="lang-de"><span class="bp-h1-em">Noch einmal</span><br>für einen klareren Entwurf…</span>
    </span>
    <span x-show="phase === 'rendering'" x-cloak>
      <span class="lang-en"><span class="bp-h1-em">Rendering</span><br>the page…</span>
      <span class="lang-ru"><span class="bp-h1-em">Собираем</span><br>страницу…</span>
      <span class="lang-de"><span class="bp-h1-em">Wir setzen</span><br>die Seite…</span>
    </span>
  </h1>
  <p class="bp-dek">
    <span class="lang-en">The page will open as soon as the narrative is ready. Closing this tab doesn't lose the work — your memory is cached for {{ retention_minutes if retention_minutes else 30 }} minutes at <code>/memory/{{ slug }}</code>.</span>
    <span class="lang-ru">Страница откроется, как только текст будет готов. Если закроете вкладку — ничего не пропадёт: воспоминание хранится {{ retention_minutes if retention_minutes else 30 }} минут по адресу <code>/memory/{{ slug }}</code>.</span>
    <span class="lang-de">Die Seite öffnet sich, sobald der Text fertig ist. Tab schließen ist kein Problem — deine Erinnerung bleibt {{ retention_minutes if retention_minutes else 30 }} Minuten unter <code>/memory/{{ slug }}</code> abrufbar.</span>
  </p>

  <section class="bp-section">
    <div class="bp-section-head">
      <span class="bp-section-num">→</span>
      <h2 class="bp-section-title">
        <span class="lang-en">Live draft</span>
        <span class="lang-ru">Черновик в реальном времени</span>
        <span class="lang-de">Entwurf live</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="bp-section-body">
      <div
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
        class="bp-livedraft"
        x-text="chunks || (lang === 'ru' ? 'Запускаемся…' : (lang === 'de' ? 'Wir starten…' : 'Starting up…'))"
      ></div>

      <p
        class="bp-mini"
        x-show="phase === 'regenerating'"
        x-cloak
      >
        <span class="lang-en">The first draft didn't parse cleanly. Trying once more before giving up — usually fixes itself.</span>
        <span class="lang-ru">Первый черновик не разобрался. Пробуем ещё раз — обычно проходит.</span>
        <span class="lang-de">Der erste Entwurf war nicht sauber. Noch ein Versuch — meistens reicht das.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bp-section bp-error" x-show="error" x-cloak role="alert">
    <div class="bp-eyebrow">
      <span class="lang-en">SOMETHING WENT WRONG</span>
      <span class="lang-ru">ЧТО-ТО ПОШЛО НЕ ТАК</span>
      <span class="lang-de">ETWAS IST SCHIEFGEGANGEN</span>
    </div>
    <p x-text="error" style="margin-top: 8px;"></p>
    <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
      <a href="/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">
        <span class="lang-en">← Start over from the form</span>
        <span class="lang-ru">← Начать заново</span>
        <span class="lang-de">← Von vorn beginnen</span>
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="bp-mini" style="margin-top: 32px; text-align: center;">
    <span class="lang-en">Your raw upload has already been deleted. Only the privacy-stripped JPEGs and the rendered page remain. <a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: inherit;">Privacy details ↗</a></span>
    <span class="lang-ru">Сырая загрузка уже удалена. Остаются только обезличенные JPEG и итоговая страница. <a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: inherit;">Подробности ↗</a></span>
    <span class="lang-de">Die Rohdaten wurden bereits gelöscht. Nur die privatsphärefreundlichen JPEGs und die fertige Seite bleiben. <a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: inherit;">Datenschutz ↗</a></span>
  </p>
</section>
{% endblock %}
